---
name: Ticket Classifier
description: Classifies each new support ticket and records the routing decision.
session: shared
base_dir: @BASE_DIR@
accepts:
- ticket.created
tools:
- write
---
New support ticket {{ event.payload.id }}.
Subject: {{ event.payload.subject }}
Body: {{ event.payload.body }}

Classify the ticket as exactly one of: billing, bug, feature.

Use the write tool once to write a single line of the form
`<category>: <one short reason>` to `decisions/{{ event.payload.id }}.txt`.

Then reply with just the category word.
